{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storm of bills is on the horizon, and a steady salary won't save you. But don't worry, we have a much more fun solution. Welcome to\u00a0Time to Pay the Bills. This is a financial roguelike where your bank account explodes thanks to a well-aimed pinball shots. You won't just be earning money; you'll be designing the very system that generates it, combining unique game-changing cards and valuable cashballs into bank-breaking synergies that will make paying off even the most outrageous bills feel like hitting the jackpot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/bb7505eafd0402e60c380d2985f63428.poster.avif?t=1761419396\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/bb7505eafd0402e60c380d2985f63428.webm?t=1761419396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/bb7505eafd0402e60c380d2985f63428.mp4?t=1761419396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay takes place on a dynamic pinball board packed with balls drawn directly from your wallet. Each shot challenges you to find the most profitable path through the board to maximize your paycheck. Every bounce is a step toward solvency, and every miscalculation brings you closer to financial collapse. Now, it becomes a financial battleground where skill and strategy collide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game goes off the rails the moment you get your first banking card \u2014 a rule-breaking upgrade that opens up new strategies and wild combos. With these cards, you are crafting a plan to outsmart rising bills and crash the economy. In the heat of each round, you can also activate single-use coupons for an extra push \u2014 apply multiplication, refresh board or even cut 20% off your bills when it matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the bills continue to rise, the real danger lies in the crisis months that introduce a temporary mutation in the rules designed specifically to challenge your winning\u00a0strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rising wave of bills is coming. Do you have a plan to prevent a financial collapse? Brace yourself \u2014 it\u2019s Time to Pay the Bills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/320d1ff0c573aae6f5e2c1d217a9fde6.poster.avif?t=1761419396\" width=780 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/320d1ff0c573aae6f5e2c1d217a9fde6.webm?t=1761419396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/320d1ff0c573aae6f5e2c1d217a9fde6.mp4?t=1761419396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931600?t=1761419396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/fc2bb00aaf53063f4c3ddfb171adabd0834115e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761419396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/bc2256fa3c4921bf9184f3b00b2f29ecf719466d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761419396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/bc2256fa3c4921bf9184f3b00b2f29ecf719466d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761419396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storm of bills is on the horizon, and a steady salary won't save you. But don't worry, we have a much more fun solution. Welcome to\u00a0Time to Pay the Bills. This is a financial roguelike where your bank account explodes thanks to a well-aimed pinball shots. You won't just be earning money; you'll be designing the very system that generates it, combining unique game-changing cards and valuable cashballs into bank-breaking synergies that will make paying off even the most outrageous bills feel like hitting the jackpot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/bb7505eafd0402e60c380d2985f63428.poster.avif?t=1761419396\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/bb7505eafd0402e60c380d2985f63428.webm?t=1761419396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/bb7505eafd0402e60c380d2985f63428.mp4?t=1761419396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay takes place on a dynamic pinball board packed with balls drawn directly from your wallet. Each shot challenges you to find the most profitable path through the board to maximize your paycheck. Every bounce is a step toward solvency, and every miscalculation brings you closer to financial collapse. Now, it becomes a financial battleground where skill and strategy collide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game goes off the rails the moment you get your first banking card \u2014 a rule-breaking upgrade that opens up new strategies and wild combos. With these cards, you are crafting a plan to outsmart rising bills and crash the economy. In the heat of each round, you can also activate single-use coupons for an extra push \u2014 apply multiplication, refresh board or even cut 20% off your bills when it matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the bills continue to rise, the real danger lies in the crisis months that introduce a temporary mutation in the rules designed specifically to challenge your winning\u00a0strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rising wave of bills is coming. Do you have a plan to prevent a financial collapse? Brace yourself \u2014 it\u2019s Time to Pay the Bills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/320d1ff0c573aae6f5e2c1d217a9fde6.poster.avif?t=1761419396\" width=780 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/320d1ff0c573aae6f5e2c1d217a9fde6.webm?t=1761419396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/320d1ff0c573aae6f5e2c1d217a9fde6.mp4?t=1761419396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Red Beans"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/18fb4bde318391c7608cded984d7c252a80d6441/header.jpg?t=1761419396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steams